		{"id":"3475540bb380a17b","type":"text","text":"# Features\nWhile [[Actions]] are the core of what your Character does in combat, Features define *how* and *why* your character acts. Features make up the bulk of the identity of your character, what they're good at, what they're bad at and what they want.","x":-3640,"y":-840,"width":440,"height":200},
